WHAT THIS DOES NOT COVER

The remaining files in sources/ are transcriptions of work published by other
people, made so that the figures in the volume can be checked:

  jazzstandards_ranked_1000.tsv      compiled by jazzstandards.com
  watkins_2010_*.tsv                 Mark Watkins, "Repertoire" (2010)
  miller_london_calls_308.tsv        David Miller's call log
  miller_published_201.tsv           David Miller's published selection

Those are not this project's to license. They are attributed in full in SOURCES.md,
which gives the address or edition of each so that anyone may take them from the
source rather than from here. Where a transcription differs from its published
source, the published source governs.

Mark Levine, The Jazz Theory Book, and Ted Gioia, The Jazz Standards, are books.
Their title lists are not reproduced in this repository at all.
